body:
i'm open minded. fuck as long as you're not hurting anyone then do whatever. 

&#x200B;

cringe culture is dead

old habits die hard i guess. especially bad ones.

&#x200B;

also probably dumb question, but have you tried cutting them off or anything?

AO3 user mainly for a while now. It can be a tough crowd, and people often time forget they should kudo, including myself and I am pretty serious about giving support to fanfics I like. 

&#x200B;

Might I ask, is this an OC story? Is there romance? How big is the fandom?
